{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S11、S12的停留时间只有22秒和25秒，Y却安排了较多叙事句和分时出现的感受提示，观众可能来不及消化；X在这两段更容易抓住主线。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"平\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段真正需要抓住的心理判断，感受文字又按音乐进程出现，降低了X右侧词群与叙事节点之间对应不清的问题。尤其在S03—S09，想念、委屈、孤独、想回去又不甘心的心理变化有更清楚的因果递进；S11—S13也更容易听出从摇摆到自主决定的过程。Y的音乐感受更具体、更细腻，能让观众把听到的音乐变化与人物经历联系起来，尽管短时段的信息密度需要控制。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f32a7023-15b7-4fea-865a-64b0d38af079", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T010955140868Z", "elapsed_seconds": 53.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:10:48.805381+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0fc296e8e588a8c688bbda05cb8a13c6401e6bb9e92347126fede7dcf5f1df22", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt